---
---

<figure
  class="fig"
  role="group"
  aria-labelledby="durable-wait-title"
  aria-describedby="durable-wait-desc"
>
  <figcaption class="sr-only">
    <span id="durable-wait-title">A human approval gate in Hatchet and in ZenML.</span>
    <span id="durable-wait-desc">Hatchet pauses a durable task on a user event and releases the worker slot at once. ZenML pauses a dynamic pipeline at wait(), marks the run PAUSED after the timeout, and resumes it with a CLI command.</span>
  </figcaption>
  <div class="panel panel--competitor">
    <div class="panel-head">
      <span class="panel-label">Hatchet · durable task on a user event</span>
      <span class="panel-sub">The worker slot is released the moment the wait starts</span>
    </div>

    <div class="dag">
      <div class="step">
        <span class="mono step-name">research</span>
        <span class="step-tag">task</span>
      </div>
      <div class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" preserveAspectRatio="none">
          <path d="M5 50 L95 50" />
          <path d="M88 42 L96 50 L88 58" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="step step--wait">
        <span class="mono step-name">approve</span>
        <span class="step-tag">durable_task</span>
      </div>
      <div class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" preserveAspectRatio="none">
          <path d="M5 50 L95 50" />
          <path d="M88 42 L96 50 L88 58" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <span class="mono step-name">publish</span>
        <span class="step-tag">task</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="call">
      <span class="mono">await ctx.aio_wait_for("approval", UserEventCondition(...))</span>
    </div>

    <div class="caption">Resumes from the journal when the event arrives. Outputs stay in run history; artifacts are your call.</div>

    <div class="foot">Durable sleeps and event waits are platform features.</div>
  </div>

  <div class="panel panel--zenml">
    <div class="panel-head">
      <span class="panel-label panel-label--accent">ZenML &middot; wait() in a dynamic pipeline</span>
      <span class="panel-sub">Run paused, artifacts kept, resumed on your command</span>
    </div>

    <div class="dag">
      <div class="step step--done">
        <span class="mono step-name">research</span>
        <span class="step-tag">artifact</span>
      </div>
      <div class="arrow arrow--accent" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" preserveAspectRatio="none">
          <path d="M5 50 L95 50" />
          <path d="M88 42 L96 50 L88 58" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="step step--accent">
        <span class="mono step-name">wait()</span>
        <span class="step-tag step-tag--accent">PAUSED</span>
      </div>
      <div class="arrow arrow--accent" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" preserveAspectRatio="none">
          <path d="M5 50 L95 50" />
          <path d="M88 42 L96 50 L88 58" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="step step--done">
        <span class="mono step-name">publish</span>
        <span class="step-tag">if approved</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="call call--accent">
      <span class="mono">zenml pipeline runs resume &lt;run&gt;</span>
    </div>

    <div class="caption">Polls until the timeout, then the run is marked PAUSED and the process can go. Resolve from the dashboard, CLI or API.</div>

    <div class="foot foot--accent">Approval gate, loops and fan-out inside the pipeline. No second engine.</div>
  </div>
</figure>

<style>
  .fig {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .sr-only {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    overflow: hidden;
    clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
    white-space: nowrap;
    border: 0;
  }
  .panel {
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 16px 16px 14px;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .panel--competitor { background: var(--color-surface-warm); }
  .panel--zenml { border-color: var(--color-accent); }

  .panel-head { margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .panel-label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .panel-label--accent { color: var(--color-accent); }
  .panel-sub {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
  }

  .dag {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 20px 1fr 20px 1fr;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .step {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    padding: 10px 8px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-light);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    min-height: 56px;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .step--done { background: var(--color-bg); }
  .step--wait { border-style: dashed; border-color: var(--color-muted); }
  .step--accent {
    background: var(--color-accent-light);
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
  }
  .step-name {
    font-size: 11.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }
  .step--accent .step-name { color: var(--color-accent); }
  .step-tag {
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--color-surface);
  }
  .step-tag--accent { color: var(--color-accent); }

  .arrow {
    height: 20px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .arrow svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 12px;
    overflow: visible;
  }
  .arrow path {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--color-muted);
    stroke-width: 1.3;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
    vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke;
  }
  .arrow--accent path { stroke: var(--color-accent); }

  .call {
    padding: 8px 12px;
    background: var(--color-bg);
    border: 1px dashed var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 6px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    font-size: 10.5px;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    text-align: center;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .call--accent { border-color: var(--color-accent); }
  .mono { font-family: var(--font-mono); }

  .caption {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    line-height: 1.45;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .foot {
    margin-top: auto;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-style: italic;
  }
  .foot--accent {
    color: var(--color-accent-deep);
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .fig { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .dag {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 6px;
    }
    .arrow {
      height: 16px;
      transform: rotate(90deg);
    }
  }
</style>
